    "final_text": "The records don't state what Kim Hale committed to delivering for the Birch Compass pilot, so I'm answering unknown.\n\nThe searches turned up no record of a Kim Hale commitment for that pilot. The closest results were these:\n- A note that Kim Hale led delivery of the pilot in its first months. It doesn't name a deliverable.\n- Kim Hale's commitments to deliver an API changelog (Dune Harbor data migration) and a rollback plan (Amber Kite launch). Both are for other projects.\n- A record that Bo Reed will deliver the API changelog for the Birch Compass beta. That is a different person and a different project phase.\n\nThe search results also didn't show record names such as r0042, so I couldn't cite any records.\n\n{\"answer\": \"unknown\", \"citations\": []}",
